# Godot binary path

`godot` is not on PATH. When running Godot from a shell (tests, export, import), call this executable by full path:

```
C:\Users\dalto\Documents\My Games\idlrPD\Godot_v4.7.2-stable_win64.exe
```

The same path is in `.vscode/settings.json` as `godotTools.editorPath.godot4` for the Godot Tools extension. Prefer the console build (`Godot_v4.7.2-stable_win64_console.exe` in the same folder) when you need reliable headless stdout, if that file exists.
